  "ruleText": "Ch 103.02 Officers. The board officers shall consist of a chairperson and a vice chairperson elected by the board at a regularly scheduled board meeting, at a minimum, once every 2 years.\n\nSource. #5624, eff 5-18-93, EXPIRED: 5-18-99\n\nNew. #7516, eff 6-27-01; ss by #8971, eff 9-11-07; ss by #14207, eff 3-7-25",
